        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This updates the TrustedType documentation for <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement.text</code> so that it includes boilerplate and security considerations.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that this links to <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement.textContent</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement.innerText</code> which are not yet defined. These were inherited from node/Element but are now in IDL - see <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-scripts\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-scripts</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Some comments by way of explanation/discussion inline.</p>",
