            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">I noticed hue interpolation was missing, so went in to add it, then noticed the first example should be basic usage and the demo has no visible code, so moved up into the intro as this page doesn't have a description.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">parameters were listed as \"values\" and was missing the hue interpolation method, so changed that.<br>\nwe really should add a description and put all this stuff under that, but that is for a different PR.</p>",
