        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the dev-docs-needed requirement of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1986688\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1986688</a> Cookies are returned with a fractional expirationDate for the change made in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1972757\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1972757</a> Store cookie expiry value as msec.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in TBC.</p>",
